{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01099",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.22,
      "end_seconds": 2.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Evening. Let's get started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.61,
      "end_seconds": 6.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 7.67,
      "end_seconds": 12.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor. I look after them so I thought I'd come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.22,
      "end_seconds": 19.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Absolutely, come and sit beside them. Did you take the bus in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.17,
      "end_seconds": 23.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I drove. The roads were quiet today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.11,
      "end_seconds": 26.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.24,
      "end_seconds": 37.05,
      "duration_seconds": 8.81,
      "text": "Well, I've been having a dry cough in the evenings. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.15,
      "end_seconds": 42.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Right, when was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.52,
      "end_seconds": 47.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "It's been going on for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.42,
      "end_seconds": 50.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.72,
      "end_seconds": 55.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Honestly, once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.37,
      "end_seconds": 57.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.62,
      "end_seconds": 77.42,
      "duration_seconds": 18.8,
      "text": "And there's sneezing fits as well, uh, about three months now. Mm, with sneezing fits, I'd give it a three, out of ten. I did have itchy eyes at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.49,
      "end_seconds": 86.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.31,
      "text": "Have you had a dry cough in the evenings before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.51,
      "end_seconds": 96.9,
      "duration_seconds": 9.39,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened a couple of years ago, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.62,
      "end_seconds": 100.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Any shortness of breath, wheeze or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.97,
      "end_seconds": 106.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "I haven't had shortness of breath, wheeze or fever, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.85,
      "end_seconds": 110.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.58,
      "end_seconds": 113.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.9,
      "end_seconds": 132.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.52,
      "end_seconds": 149.92,
      "duration_seconds": 16.4,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I gave up cigarettes last spring. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.88,
      "end_seconds": 154.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.73,
      "end_seconds": 159.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.37,
      "end_seconds": 172.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.12,
      "end_seconds": 176.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "I had a bunion operation six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.59,
      "end_seconds": 183.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.28,
      "end_seconds": 194.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.97,
      "text": "Oh, I've had migraines for nearly five years now. I have arthritis in my knees, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.64,
      "end_seconds": 197.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.1,
      "end_seconds": 201.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Epilepsy, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.53,
      "end_seconds": 209.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "Yes. Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.18,
      "end_seconds": 216.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 217.55,
      "end_seconds": 225.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "Actually, I remember she had some kind of reaction to erythromycin before. I couldn't swear to it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.3,
      "end_seconds": 228.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "I don't remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.65,
      "end_seconds": 236.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Alright, so that's unclear. I'll record what each of you said."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.88,
      "end_seconds": 259.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.74,
      "end_seconds": 273.62,
      "duration_seconds": 13.88,
      "text": "I'm on propranolol, 40 milligrams, twice a day. I take naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day. Sodium valproate, 500 milligrams, twice a day for the fits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.66,
      "end_seconds": 280.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.09,
      "end_seconds": 282.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "About six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.21,
      "end_seconds": 288.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.76,
      "end_seconds": 303.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.96,
      "end_seconds": 326.32,
      "duration_seconds": 8.36,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.6, pressure 113 over 75, respiratory rate 17, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, pulse 79."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.32,
      "end_seconds": 331.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.5,
      "end_seconds": 335.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.03,
      "end_seconds": 348.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Your chest is clear and your nose looks a little swollen inside."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.49,
      "end_seconds": 351.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.58,
      "end_seconds": 379.3,
      "duration_seconds": 24.72,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Putting it all together, I think we're dealing with seasonal hay fever causing the cough at this stage. I'd also keep early asthma in mind. The treatment will be fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, once a day, for the season. That should help with hay fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 380.59,
      "end_seconds": 383.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Is that safe with my other medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.42,
      "end_seconds": 396.19,
      "duration_seconds": 10.77,
      "text": "Keep windows closed on high-pollen days and wash your hair at night. If you start wheezing, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 398.22,
      "end_seconds": 399.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Okay, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 401.9,
      "end_seconds": 407.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Book a review in a month. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 408.3,
      "end_seconds": 412.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}